WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From Mountain, shift into the left foot and lift the right knee.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Hold the right big toe with the left hand and extend the leg forward.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Open the right arm to the side and twist the torso toward the right.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the standing hip steady; gaze follows the open arm.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then release and switch sides.
